# Stable, vendor-neutral URLs for release verification artifacts.
#
# The company is Sparcle Inc and the org is SparcleHQ; the old Sparcle-LLC name still redirects, so
# raw release URL prints an outdated legal name in front of anyone verifying a download. These
# redirects let the documentation, the installer, and the trust pages reference sparcle.app
# only. Renaming the org would rewrite every historical release URL, every installed client's
# updater endpoint, and the manifests already submitted to winget and Homebrew, so this is the
# surface fix; the rename stays a separate, deliberate decision.
/releases/latest/SHA256SUMS          https://github.com/SparcleHQ/sparcle.app/releases/latest/download/SHA256SUMS          302
/releases/latest/SHA256SUMS.minisig  https://github.com/SparcleHQ/sparcle.app/releases/latest/download/SHA256SUMS.minisig  302
/releases/latest/VIRUSTOTAL.md       https://github.com/SparcleHQ/sparcle.app/releases/latest/download/VIRUSTOTAL.md       302
